<title>USA: Philip Morris executive vp James Kilts quits.</title>
<headline>Philip Morris executive vp James Kilts quits.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philip Morris Cos Inc said on Monday that James Kilts has resigned his position as executive vice-president, worldwide food, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The company said Kilts resignation resulted from his desire to have a more direct role in managing a major food business.</p>
<p>The company declined to comment on whether or when a replacement would be named.</p>
